You should be fine without all that stuff.  You will be surprised how
little you need all that junk.  So long as you have a weapon, low AC
and your resistances you'll be OK.

But you don't have low AC.  Your armor situration is dire.  You
shouldn't go near the castle until you're around -15 at least.  Buy all
the protection you can first. Once there, you can get the wand of
wishing and fix your armor situation in a hurry.

Since you've cleared almost everything, I would go ahead with Medusa
and the castle.  You are at great risk fighting the minotaur(s) before
the castle as well.  Stay away from them at all costs.  Use your pets.
Then use the mastermind gate trick to clear the castle, get your wand
and power up.

You cannot do your quest without and reflection magic resistance so do
the castle first.   Once you're armored up, find a way to do your quest
without letting the cyclops hit you.  

Good luck!



